00:00:48.213 --> 00:00:50.763
- Stop pitying yourself.

00:00:50.763 --> 00:00:52.596
Stop pitying yourself.

00:00:53.999 --> 00:00:57.082
Stop looking at yourself as a victim.

00:01:01.581 --> 00:01:03.938
That is one thing you must stop doing

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:06.740
if you want to attain anything in life.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:07.672
You know what.

00:01:07.672 --> 00:01:09.255
Life is about pain.

00:01:10.113 --> 00:01:14.179
Everybody one time or
the other feels pain.

00:01:14.179 --> 00:01:16.700
And if you are afraid of pain or you want

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:19.982
to run away from pain all the time,

00:01:19.982 --> 00:01:23.584
that means you pity yourself too much.

00:01:23.584 --> 00:01:26.925
And if you run away too much from pain,

00:01:26.925 --> 00:01:28.342
then you will not

00:01:30.425 --> 00:01:32.348
have any progress

00:01:32.348 --> 00:01:36.890
or you will not experience
any change in life whatsoever.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:39.140
Every change requires pain.

00:01:39.998 --> 00:01:43.938
For example, if you want to
sit down at home and study

00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:45.355
and not watch TV,

00:01:48.097 --> 00:01:50.742
and not go to play with your friends,

00:01:50.742 --> 00:01:54.431
that costs something,
that causes some pain.

00:01:54.431 --> 00:01:56.084
If you want to be
different from other people

00:01:56.084 --> 00:01:58.710
people that criticize
you and talk about you,

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:00.096
that causes some pain.

00:02:00.096 --> 00:02:04.483
But those pain are what
I call voluntary pains.

00:02:04.483 --> 00:02:09.264
They are pains that you need
to pay the price of right now

00:02:09.264 --> 00:02:12.258
so that you'll be able
to avoid greater pain

00:02:12.258 --> 00:02:14.125
later on in life.

00:02:14.125 --> 00:02:18.929
But if you are somebody
that likes comfort too much

00:02:18.929 --> 00:02:23.046
and you think that any
correction or any process of pain

00:02:23.046 --> 00:02:26.264
is too much for you or is deadly for you,

00:02:26.264 --> 00:02:28.347
or is unbearable for you,

00:02:30.181 --> 00:02:33.692
you will only be pitying yourself.

00:02:33.692 --> 00:02:37.590
And if all you're doing
is just pitying yourself,

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.915
you will never become a better person.

00:02:39.915 --> 00:02:44.131
Sometimes we all need to
be tough on ourselves.

00:02:44.131 --> 00:02:45.763
Be tough on yourself.

00:02:45.763 --> 00:02:48.396
Get your flesh out of that bed

00:02:48.396 --> 00:02:51.694
and go do what you need to do.

00:02:51.694 --> 00:02:55.777
Sometimes you need to
force your flesh to listen.

00:02:56.735 --> 00:03:00.318
Don't let the flesh
have dominion over you.

00:03:01.154 --> 00:03:03.159
Get to doing what you need to do

00:03:03.159 --> 00:03:05.909
and let that flesh feel that pain

00:03:07.104 --> 00:03:10.539
so that you might get the
results you desire in your life.

00:03:10.539 --> 00:03:13.184
Stop pitying yourself.

00:03:13.184 --> 00:03:16.736
Success is one thing that is hidden

00:03:16.736 --> 00:03:19.745
in the most unlikely of places.

00:03:19.745 --> 00:03:22.267
And one of the places
that success is hidden

00:03:22.267 --> 00:03:25.585
is in doing what you
don't feel like doing.

00:03:25.585 --> 00:03:29.733
Most of the time, we do
what we feel like doing

00:03:29.733 --> 00:03:32.729
and we don't do what we
don't feel like doing.

00:03:32.729 --> 00:03:34.896
Just like a kid or a child

00:03:36.333 --> 00:03:38.543
that doesn't want to wake up

00:03:38.543 --> 00:03:40.135
in the morning to go to school.

00:03:40.135 --> 00:03:42.076
But you make them go to school

00:03:42.076 --> 00:03:43.661
because that is the way to success.

00:03:43.661 --> 00:03:48.088
Success, the same thing with
adults, a failure is somebody

00:03:48.088 --> 00:03:52.337
that gives to his flesh and
to his body what they want.

00:03:52.337 --> 00:03:55.560
Your body wants to eat chocolate
and ice cream all the time,

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.635
you eat it all the time.

00:03:57.635 --> 00:03:59.789
You do what you feel like doing.

00:03:59.789 --> 00:04:03.039
Well that will lead you to being obese.

00:04:05.448 --> 00:04:09.003
If you feel like going to work, you go.

00:04:09.003 --> 00:04:11.525
But if you don't feel
like going, you don't go.

00:04:11.525 --> 00:04:14.569
Or if you feel like studying, you study.

00:04:14.569 --> 00:04:16.754
But if you don't feel like
studying, you don't study.

00:04:16.754 --> 00:04:20.754
If you do what you feel
like doing all the time,

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:24.955
you'll become a failure in life.

00:04:24.955 --> 00:04:27.425
But in life you've got to
do what you need to do.

00:04:27.425 --> 00:04:30.440
You've got to do what you
don't feel like doing.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:33.158
If it needs to be done, if
you need to study, you study

00:04:33.158 --> 00:04:34.711
even if you don't feel like studying.

00:04:34.711 --> 00:04:37.526
And if you need to go to
work, even if you don't feel

00:04:37.526 --> 00:04:39.527
like going to work, you go to work

00:04:39.527 --> 00:04:41.481
because that is the right thing to do.

00:04:41.481 --> 00:04:44.143
So successful people are people who force

00:04:44.143 --> 00:04:47.245
themselves to do the right thing to do.

00:04:47.245 --> 00:04:51.312
They force themselves to
do what they need to do

00:04:51.312 --> 00:04:54.208
rather than going out there

00:04:54.208 --> 00:04:56.716
to do only what they feel like doing.

00:04:56.716 --> 00:04:59.035
But they actually do what
they don't feel like doing

00:04:59.035 --> 00:05:01.281
because they know it is needed to be done.

00:05:01.281 --> 00:05:04.813
So if you really want
to be successful in life

00:05:04.813 --> 00:05:08.318
don't look for the easy
things in life to do.

00:05:08.318 --> 00:05:10.215
Look for the things that are difficult

00:05:10.215 --> 00:05:12.067
even if you don't feel like doing it.

00:05:12.067 --> 00:05:13.734
But when you do it anyway,

00:05:13.734 --> 00:05:16.651
that is the quickest way to success

00:05:18.459 --> 00:05:22.054
when you break your flesh,
when you humble your desires

00:05:22.054 --> 00:05:24.710
and you go to do the
things that you need to do

00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:27.184
even if you don't feel like doing it.

00:05:27.184 --> 00:05:29.101
Well, success is hidden

00:05:31.152 --> 00:05:34.395
in the most impossible of places.

00:05:34.395 --> 00:05:37.269
In the place of pain when
you go to do the things

00:05:37.269 --> 00:05:40.374
