00:17:46.515 --> 00:17:48.333
Time is more than money.

00:17:48.333 --> 00:17:49.745
Time is more than gold.

00:17:49.745 --> 00:17:52.441
Time is more than precious silver.

00:17:52.441 --> 00:17:54.274
Time is equal to life.

00:17:55.179 --> 00:17:59.794
Because our life itself
is a totality of time.

00:17:59.794 --> 00:18:01.702
So if we say a child is born,

00:18:01.702 --> 00:18:05.035
