the person is 20 years old,

00:18:13.917 --> 00:18:15.618
that 20 years that we refer to,

00:18:15.618 --> 00:18:17.827
or that five years we refer to,

00:18:17.827 --> 00:18:20.609
or 10 years that we refer to,

00:18:20.609 --> 00:18:23.246
is a subtotal of time.

00:18:23.246 --> 00:18:27.140
