00:19:16.955 --> 00:19:18.953
How do you spend your time?

00:19:18.953 --> 00:19:19.885
Do you waste your time?

00:19:19.885 --> 00:19:21.598
If you waste your time,
you waste your life.

00:19:21.598 --> 00:19:23.465
If you waste your time,
other people will waste

00:19:23.465 --> 00:19:26.418
