00:27:54.442 --> 00:27:56.087
No, that is deception.

00:27:56.087 --> 00:27:58.648
You cannot have everything just at once.

00:27:58.648 --> 00:28:02.481
You must be willing and
ready to painstakingly

00:28:04.720 --> 00:28:07.506
go through the process of production.

00:28:07.506 --> 00:28:10.999
You must not be one of
those ones that want to have

00:28:10.999 --> 00:28:12.259
something for nothing.

00:28:12.259 --> 00:28:13.574
You must not be one of those people

00:28:13.574 --> 00:28:16.018
that want to have
something where you don't

00:28:16.018 --> 00:28:17.834
pay the price for it.

00:28:17.834 --> 00:28:19.770
You must be willing to
pay the price for anything

00:28:19.770 --> 00:28:22.042
that you desire to have in life.

00:28:22.042 --> 00:28:25.150
Don't just have a goal,
but be willing to work

00:28:25.150 --> 00:28:28.067
and go through the process of pain,

00:28:29.982 --> 00:28:33.815
of endurance, of sacrifice,
of labor, of work.

00:28:35.598 --> 00:28:38.268
Just make sure you follow the order.

00:28:38.268 --> 00:28:39.705
Make sure you follow the rules.

00:28:39.705 --> 00:28:42.566
Make sure you follow due
process so that you'll be able

00:28:42.566 --> 00:28:44.082
to get where you want to go.

00:28:44.082 --> 00:28:47.712
Because that is the only
thing that can assure you

00:28:47.712 --> 00:28:50.409
or give you a lasting success.

00:28:50.409 --> 00:28:53.082
So you must be a person of process.

00:28:53.082 --> 00:28:54.337
You must be thorough.

00:28:54.337 --> 00:28:56.099
You must be diligent.

00:28:56.099 --> 00:28:58.374
You must learn to pay attention to details

00:28:58.374 --> 00:29:01.899
and to minute insignificant things.

00:29:01.899 --> 00:29:05.286
So you must pay attention to
the details and the process

00:29:05.286 --> 00:29:07.894
of creation, the process of production,

00:29:07.894 --> 00:29:10.977
the process from getting from a to b.

00:29:12.133 --> 00:29:13.332
You must be thorough.

00:29:13.332 --> 00:29:15.404
You must make sure that
you follow the rules.

00:29:15.404 --> 00:29:18.265
You must make sure that
you don't omit any single

00:29:18.265 --> 00:29:23.157
or any small point in your
quest to go and get to where

00:29:23.157 --> 00:29:25.366
you wish to find yourself.

00:29:25.366 --> 00:29:27.583
So be a thorough, diligent person.

00:29:27.583 --> 00:29:31.786
Diligence and being thorough
to follow through the process

00:29:31.786 --> 00:29:35.786
is a major factor to
becoming successful in life

